Preserve earlier purposeful source repairs through downstream consumer/context adaptations; exact conflict ledger retained.
All60 authored input payloads retained, with prerequisite-aware same-purpose splits; distinct legacy-index and inherited CXX compatibility remain independent. Pre-format source equals exact403+all60 control tree95718fceff83364b74294a751bd752b2f1a4e384. Only pinnedRuff import/format cleanup follows. Original author commands/hashes are historical reference evidence, not combined405 approval. Reference OFF/native/Rust full gates are preserved separately; combined compile/runtime NOT_RUN.

Coordinator causal native prerequisite repair (2026-10-20):
At native miner owner116, supply the exact native UtxoOverlayArena implementation already declared by that owner; remove its later duplicate at overlay126. Keep unrelated monetary initialization, transaction bookkeeping and positional overlay removal at126.
Define the existing native default monetary-profile accessor alongside its declaration at116, with the exact later126 constant; do not move later monetary initialization/effective-cost behavior.
Retain LookupCoinInStack declaration until overlay126 actually removes its implementation; avoids premature native-header removal.
Exact original failed native compilation and one diagnostic inventory are retained. This is an introduced-defect/API-consumer fix, not a new purpose. Final source tree and507count remain unchanged; rootbenchmarkworker owns repairedprefix compilation.

Coordinator historical implementation recovery (2026-10-21):
Retire the shared flat-table eager UTXO batch adapter when this existing native owner replaces it with its fully lazy native bookkeeping; do not restore speculative eager native work.
